<title>FRANCE: SGB selling Accor stake - fund managers.</title>
<headline>SGB selling Accor stake - fund managers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale de Belgique, a subsidiary of Compagnie de Suez, is selling its eight percent stake in French hotel group Accor at 756 francs per share, fund managers said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
